'''Ultimate Ben''' was the special transformation accessible to [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]] using his [[Omnitrix (Ultimate Alien Future)|Omnitrix]] that gave him the powers of his aliens without leaving his human form.

==Appearance==
Ultimate Ben looked exactly like [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]] in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''. However, rather than wearing the [[Omnitrix (Ultimate Alien Future)|Omnitrix]] on his wrist, he instead wore an evolved Omnitrix symbol on his chest.

When channeling [[Ultimate Humungousaur]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben's body grew larger and much more muscular, with his fingers and body shape resembling Ultimate Humungousaur's.

