{{Quote|"'Ultimate Ben'?"<br>"What power comes with that?"<br>"Pretty much all of 'em. You'll figure it out some day."|[[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]], [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and Ultimate Ben.<ref name="B10KR"/>}}
In this form, [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben]] was able to select any{{Refn|[[:File:Q&A With Matt Wayne on 17th November 2013, 12 42 am.PNG]]|group = MW|name = MWQ&A}} alien from his evolved [[Omnitrix (Ultimate Alien Future)|Omnitrix]] symbol and press it to "become" them, at which point a hologram of the alien would appear behind him. Ultimate Ben would remain human, but have complete access to the selected alien's abilities; though his body and physique changed occaisionally, as was the case with [[Ultimate Humungousaur]]. This allowed Ben to be faster and more efficient when using multiple aliens, as he could quickly and effectively switch between them.{{Refn|group = MW|name = MWQ&A}}

While accessing Ultimate Humungousaur's powers, Ultimate Ben gained immense strength, enough to both cause an impact by smashing the ground and easily toss [[Eon's Minions (Ben 10,000 Returns)|Eon's minions]].<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing [[Arctiguana]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben could blow an icy breath from his mouth.<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben could project fire from his hands.<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing [[Clockwork]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben could fire green time rays from his hands.<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing an unspecified alien's powers, Ultimate Ben could fire freeze rays from his hands.{{Refn|[[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]] (as Ultimate Ben) used an alien's powers off-screen, and as the camera panned back to him, he was shown to have shot ice out of his hands.<ref name="B10KR"/> [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]] is the only known alien that has demonstrated this specific ability so far,<ref>''[[Singlehanded]]''</ref> but it is ultimately unclear what alien was used.|group = note}}

While accessing [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben gained enhanced agility, jumping and acrobatics.<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben could fly and levitate. He also had enhanced strength, as shown when he was able to catch a fast-moving [[Rustbucket 3]] out of the air and ground it before it fell into a cliff.<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing [[XLR8 (Classic)|XLR8]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben could run at high speeds. His sharpened reflexes also allowed him to change direction very easily while running.<ref name="B10KR" />

While accessing [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]]'s powers, Ultimate Ben could cause crystal formations to grow rapidly from underneath the ground and erupt to the surface, even at a distance. He could also fire crystal shards sequentially out of his fists as projectiles.<ref name="B10KR" />

==History==
===Ultimate Alien Future===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns|Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Ultimate Ben was used twice. First, he was used to fight [[Eon's Minions (Ben 10,000 Returns)|Eon's minions]] in [[Tennyson Tower|his headquarters]]. Second, he was used to fight Eon's minions on the [[Rustbucket 3]] and remained transformed for the rest of the episode.

