==Trivia==
*[[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]] considered Ultimate Ben to be his best transformation, as he could use that form to utilize any other alien's powers.
**In stark contrast to the [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|original Ben 10,000]] he met who was almost always in alien form, this Ben always uses Ultimate Ben to use other aliens' powers while still being himself.
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] thought Ultimate Ben was a really lame idea.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Ben Is Lame.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Originally, when Ultimate Ben accessed Ultimate Humungousaur's powers, he was also supposed to be able to shoot missiles, too.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/8/89/Ben_10k_Returns_DRAFT-1.pdf ''Ben 10,000 Returns'' First Draft]|group = script|name = script}}
*A fan asked [[Dwayne McDuffie]] as early as July 31st, 2010 what a [[Human (Classic)|Human]]'s [[Ultimate Forms|ultimate form]] would be; he responded then to "wait and see".{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DM}}

